{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":28435,\"title\":\"Murders in the Rue Morgue\",\"tagline\":\"The super shocker !\",\"overview\":\"In 19th century Paris, a maniac abducts young women and injects them with ape blood in an attempt to prove ape-human kinship but constantly meets failure as the abducted women die.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vd7APCDkYTL0ZpNc88XB1uEYCQx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sLdz4K32OUP8cKk5G58e0JLofY9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"voteCount\":154,\"year\":1932,\"runtime\":61,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Robert Florey\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":29808,\"name\":\"Robert Florey\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cRX6qkTniwyr1Kt0yTWIlqHO25F.jpg\"},{\"id\":100789,\"name\":\"Sidney Fox\",\"character\":\"Mlle. Camille L'Espanaye\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sx5zFFZdY20mUY77tdPztDcwx0e.jpg\"},{\"id\":1547,\"name\":\"Bela Lugosi\",\"character\":\"Dr. Mirakle\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fwimu7WKcaJXIjaDwYQg42GxUxa.jpg\"},{\"id\":13994,\"name\":\"Leon Ames\",\"character\":\"Pierre Dupin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/QyNQUvF8jD6sNdBY0a3O3hgLSQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":29987,\"name\":\"Bert Roach\",\"character\":\"Paul\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q9EUBkdaWo5cBceHN3L97nINtWh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1079577,\"name\":\"Betty Ross Clarke\",\"character\":\"Mme. L'Espanaye\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fwfaSuSsO4UxZSakz2a55IOweTp.jpg\"},{\"id\":29580,\"name\":\"Brandon Hurst\",\"character\":\"Prefect of Police\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jU1SqbZ6de4cMQJo3rpsdkNJqD9.jpg\"},{\"id\":129329,\"name\":\"D'Arcy Corrigan\",\"character\":\"Morgue Keeper\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xFQ6gD1U4OxKu5gjL1qiy5TFgwa.jpg\"},{\"id\":3247,\"name\":\"Noble Johnson\",\"character\":\"Janos The Black One\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ktN2dIxPBTdt7RqpFoWD0upCbUp.jpg\"},{\"id\":5791,\"name\":\"Arlene Francis\",\"character\":\"Woman of the Streets\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u6dNWXP49lIf0Sn17tZ9DkcYFP9.jpg\"},{\"id\":2936,\"name\":\"Ted Billings\",\"character\":\"Sideshow Spectator (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dYMTJxnuLBfVMWApCFhVDhohF5f.jpg\"},{\"id\":9084,\"name\":\"Herman Bing\",\"character\":\"Franz Odenheimer (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/62SmiO7zFXABLqJeKbLjIjc0FHl.jpg\"},{\"id\":587131,\"name\":\"Joe Bonomo\",\"character\":\"Gorilla (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9iUlrtqxErFBCUVxnRhIoJYNE37.jpg\"},{\"id\":1016595,\"name\":\"Agostino Borgato\",\"character\":\"Alberto Montani (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":127032,\"name\":\"Iron Eyes Cody\",\"character\":\"Indian at Sideshow (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/23h9CuvnyzjJGYsodDTXbiaBuA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1050210,\"name\":\"Christian J. Frank\",\"character\":\"Gendarme Using Snuff (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ooszd70g0ROC7ijlCKeCWbT64cH.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1159559,\"title\":\"Scream 7\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jjyuk0edLiW8vOSnlfwWCCLpbh5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3eUyLEF5M0ky3h6KJsWiWzaakB8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a new Ghostface killer emerges in the quiet town where Sidney Prescott has built a new life, her darkest fears are realized as her daughter becomes the next target. Determined to protect her family, Sidney must face the horrors of her past to put an end to the bloodshed once and for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":176,\"title\":\"Saw\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4da0TS3iQ1IzuyhDS8elgkmOfrN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ok4ot3YbfDYZcINXf91JUfq3maB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two men wake up to find themselves shackled in a grimy, abandoned bathroom. As they struggle to comprehend their predicament, they discover a disturbing tape left behind by the sadistic mastermind known as Jigsaw. With a chilling voice and cryptic instructions, Jigsaw informs them that they must partake in a gruesome game in order to secure their freedom.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226578,\"title\":\"Longlegs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1EwNyiiNFd863H4e8nWEzutnZD7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ToGkmqn0KG0UGGGUAC1Ww0e5CM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"FBI Agent Lee Harker is a gifted new recruit assigned to the unsolved case of an elusive serial killer. As the case takes complex turns, unearthing evidence of the occult, Harker discovers a personal connection to the merciless killer and must race against time to stop him before he claims the lives of another innocent family.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1107166,\"title\":\"Psycho Killer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5xgxxmLivJXL8aF0HdZfpx8aAIo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOcgmSwbCFW7h1rmEqMvYPzvjh7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the brutal murder of her husband, a Kansas highway patrol officer sets out on a journey to track down the perpetrator. As the hunt progresses, she comes to realize the man responsible is a sadistic serial killer, and the depth of his mental depravity and his sinister agenda is more twisted than anyone could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":800815,\"title\":\"The Pale Blue Eye\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9xkGlFRqrN8btTLU0KQvOfn2PHr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/exEXLc85nYPtztn1u3KJ8wU0uJX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"West Point, New York, 1830. When a cadet at the burgeoning military academy is found hanged with his heart cut out, the top brass summons former New York City constable Augustus Landor to investigate. While attempting to solve this grisly mystery, the reluctant detective engages the help of one of the cadets: a strange but brilliant young fellow by the name of Edgar Allan Poe.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":372343,\"title\":\"The Snowman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mKsQ8KMOk0VBX26Ev0Lj6EmfGJu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfBUlspOpxPavxrhkhvzlBlwfD8.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Detective Harry Hole investigates the disappearance of a woman whose pink scarf is found wrapped around an ominous looking snowman.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38410,\"title\":\"The Poughkeepsie Tapes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ppkhu3pO3fnXr05YeE7ryKloVd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tAi9xQKBgYJVkBTfAtZ0OHEaXfb.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When hundreds of videotapes showing torture, murder and dismemberment are found in an abandoned house, they reveal a serial killer's decade-long reign of terror and become the most disturbing collection of evidence homicide detectives have ever seen.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1210938,\"title\":\"Revelations\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ak0HlRVsVzh8mvwIUZpZr0z6uqW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ljaRxXl7XzffsQU4LxFnaiIhglv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A pastor who believes in divine revelation and a detective haunted by visions pursue a missing person case — exposing their own demons in the process.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844398,\"title\":\"Shattered\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkMhuIYybOmw0rdIKPzsDs4n7ez.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2KkEHansZHktiIo89wfGgaa23J.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chris, a wealthy divorcee, lives in a high-tech house of his own design in Montana. His life changes when he meets Sky, a mysterious young woman who draws him out of his shell and moves in after Chris is injured.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8090,\"title\":\"Untraceable\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ySUwDRDEn01lKIMPQorpFCMLWqE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eIjrpeXSiSq0CN6AE44trDAPRau.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084863,\"title\":\"The Soul Eater\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8XsQVmGQukwIVDM88Aa0C7L5hCp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1fYIvYIwAWID27ZsmpOzAcEDOCv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the disappearance of children and bloody murders multiply in a small mountain village, an old legend shrouded in sulphur reappears... Commander Guardiano and Captain of the Gendarmerie De Rolan are forced to join forces to uncover the truth.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":556509,\"title\":\"Svaha: The Sixth Finger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yE6q03pfWg9xZ4a7MoeldDXMV5y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vUTx2JxgDPRW3MYzXwGZXkhSWGV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pastor Park, the head of a religious investigation center that exposes cults and cult leaders, begins looking into a suspicious new religion called Deer Mount.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"W3ONG8qFw_4\",\"name\":\"Murders in the Rue Morgue (1932) Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}